# Research Notices

This optional file is enabled as a human-facing map of consequential research developments. It helps a user or cold-start agent notice what changed and why it matters; it is not scientific evidence, a second result index, a research plan, a task queue, or a session log.

There are no notices yet. Add natural, compact prose only when omitting a development could cause a future reader to misunderstand the mainline, repeat a costly stopped route, or miss a result that changes the research decision. Let nearby scientific adjudication finish when useful, coalesce the chain into one account, and link the authoritative source, derivation, calculation, configuration, or verifier.
